# No AI Attribution

Never add AI/tool attribution to commit messages, PR descriptions, or code comments. This includes phrases like "made with Cursor", "generated by Cursor", "Co-authored-by: Cursor", "written by AI", "via Claude", or similar.

Keep commit messages and comments focused on the change itself and the reasoning behind it.

```
# BAD
Add login handler

Made with Cursor.

# GOOD
Add login handler

Validates credentials against the auth service before issuing a session token.
```

```go
// BAD
// Generated by Cursor: parses the config file
func parseConfig(path string) (*Config, error) { ... }

// GOOD
// parseConfig reads YAML config and applies environment overrides.
func parseConfig(path string) (*Config, error) { ... }
```
